  "schema:name": "Care Transition Management: Structured handoffs and continuity protocols between care settings and providers.",
  "schema:description": "Care transition management - Structured handoffs and continuity protocols between care settings and providers.\r\nMotivation: \r\nSince we are under the Quality and Continuity of Care Goal, it is important to consider this subgoal as main driver for patient safety, avoid redundant care (duplication of tests) and patient care continuity gaps.",
